msgid "Messenger accounts and brands"
msgstr ""

#: app/admin/settings_layout.py:149
msgid ""
"JSON: the account each brand owns on each messenger. Which application "
"may send under which brand is set on that application's own page (Apps), "
"not here."
msgstr ""

